The `add_ticket` method of the `TicketingSystem` class allows you to add a new ticket to the system, specifying the type of ticket (either regular, VIP, or student) and the seat number. If a seat number is not specified, an error is raised. If the seat number is already taken by another ticket, an error is raised.

